 "notes": [
  "Qty 59 as published (no section headers; quantities as prefixes, e.g. '3 vader', '4 senses'): 11 sites/starting cards, 3 (Bubo and two lightsabers), 19 characters, 3 vehicles, 5 starships, 18 Interrupts/Effects.",
  "No Objective. 'Marker3 and 5 (hoth) (start)' is two starting sites, Hoth: Defensive Perimeter (3rd Marker) and Hoth: Ice Plains (5th Marker); the first is set as the starting card. Combat Readiness is listed right after them and is the starting Interrupt that pulls the second site.",
  "'dark bith shuffle': The Bith Shuffle is a Light card and there is no Dark card of that name: kept as posted (UNKNOWN).",
  "Posted 'shock' dested Shocking Revelation (the Dark 'shock' Interrupt); 'veers' General Veers (the Hoth card; the GEMP-only intro-game 'Veers' is not meant); 'tarkin' Grand Moff Tarkin; '3 vader' Darth Vader; '2 mara' Mara Jade, The Emperor's Hand; 'danger w/ gun' Dengar With Blaster Carbine; 'id-88 in ship' IG-88 In IG-2000; 'bossk in bus' Bossk In Hound's Tooth; 'bossk w/ gun' Bossk With Mortar Gun; 'broken con' Broken Concentration; 'wamp cave' Hoth: Wampa Cave (7th Marker); 'ccdown town plazas' Cloud City: Downtown Plaza; 'Dr. e' Dr. Evazan.",
  "Resistance, Secret Plans and Security Precautions are the older Effects (March 2000; Defensive Shields came later)."
